Adr2GkT6u4k9C-4FqTe0RLBfVJql6fWOe3rc8ROgYDxh1ND7O6b_5ad-gpzerWYWGzo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBILbt_AIA9SggEBZc8vE640PM566bj_F2BYnWYwJ91Fw&oe=6A4B9B37"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "2056833998595482", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295279_2056834001928815_3978146616395585472_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zUlp3IIcOS8Q7kNvwEbnQEb&_nc_oc=AdoHQhH10ggYDrgF4j_zNb9mY838s-pSE4DSs6j-N0bbHnq9jbRxKud-nS3PSJ2qOoE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAzFDa8bEtEkp12FyASCs27-bk-j9-bncEQ_LhixYQGsw&oe=6A4BBBEF"}, "display_name": "VR Viewer for Insta360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VR Viewer for Insta360 turns your Meta Quest into a personal 360\u00b0 cinema for footage from your Insta360 camera (X5, X4, X3, ONE X / X2, ONE R / RS 360).\n\nThree ways to watch:\n\u2022 Camera over USB \u2014 plug your camera into the Quest and play your shots, transcoded at the best resolution for your headset.\n\u2022 Insta360 Cloud \u2014 open a public Insta360 share link and stream a whole album in VR; browse a thumbnail gallery and pick any clip.\n\u2022 Offline cache \u2014 everything you've opened is saved for instant, offline replay.\n\nFeatures:\n- True immersive 360\u00b0 playback with smooth head-tracking.\n- Multi-file cloud albums with a built-in gallery and a history of opened links.\n- Automatic per-headset resolution \u2014 each device gets exactly the sharpness its display can show.\n- 9 languages, auto-selected from your system language.\n- Comfortable VR interface controlled with the Touch controllers.\n\nNote: this is a 360\u00b0 viewer. Single-lens cameras (GO, Ace, Link) record flat video and are not supported. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Insta360 / Arashi Vision.\n", "short_description": "Watch your Insta360 360\u00b0 videos in VR \u2014 from camera, cloud, or offline."